[[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3237529\">1048A34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the cam angle sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Timing sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236565\">K47</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo bolt (2a) and remove cam angle sensor (2b) from the right\nhand cylinder head.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013561.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[48,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the cam angle sensor and secure to\nthe right cylinder head using the bolt.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\ncam angle sensor.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237529\">1048A34</a></p>"],[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a hoist.</p><p>Disconnect the negative battery terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235042\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Follow these operations:</p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237651\">1016A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237490\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237667\">1032B52</a></p>"],[6,127,0,"<p>1. Unscrew screws (1a) and remove sensor (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014104.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Assemble the timing sensor.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237667\">1032B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237490\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237651\">1016A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237641\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p>Connect the negative battery sensor.</p>"]]